{"Time":"2026-10-06T16:21:15.453122+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04A01","Output":"W04_ASSERTION {\"actual\":[true,4,0,\"DRAFT\"],\"assertion_id\":\"A01-01\",\"evidence\":{\"goal\":{\"acceptance_contract\":{\"checks\":[{\"check_id\":\"C01\",\"command_key\":\"test.context\",\"expected\":\"目标、未完成任务ID、有效决定revision全部一致。\\n旧决定只可作为历史显示；不会恢复为生效决定；向用户索取已存在材料次数为0。\\nContextBundle包含原始记录引用及快照hash，能回查每个引用。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C02\",\"command_key\":\"test.security\",\"expected\":\"所有A的响应/日志/ContextBundle不含B的秘密标记；越权请求不返回B正文。\\n通用知识可读且保留来源、授权范围、版本；共享不扩大为B全项目权限。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C03\",\"command_key\":\"test.domain\",\"expected\":\"T1为NEEDS_REVALIDATION，A1为STALE；集合恰为两"}
{"Time":"2026-10-06T16:21:15.453122+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04A01","Output":"个受影响对象。\\nT2可继续且不因本次变更进入NEEDS_REVALIDATION。\\n旧结果可封存为历史，但不能成为current或ACCEPTED；过期If-Match写入返回412，状态不兼容提交返回409。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C04\",\"command_key\":\"test.context\",\"expected\":\"只有一个同revision写入成功；另一请求412且不覆盖；整合后恰有一个当前生效决定。\\n相同事件ID最多产生一次业务副作用；缺前序事件先补取/等待，不倒退状态。\\n相同幂等键/相同请求重放原结果；同键不同请求返回409。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C05\",\"command_key\":\"test.experiments\",\"expected\":\"本轮COMPLETE，必需来源/实验均已完成且游标已保存；负结果不被标为执行错误。\\nADOPT数量为0，项目实现版本不变；结论保留证"}
{"Time":"2026-10-06T16:21:15.453122+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04A01","Output":"据和原因，不声称功能/质量已提升。\\nWATCH/INCONCLUSIVE有明确缺口及复查触发；重要排除可形成里程碑，普通空轮不强制通知。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C06\",\"command_key\":\"test.research.fixture\",\"expected\":\"GitHub/论文继续且保存回执、时间窗口和游标；不因X失败全部中止。\\n必需X未完成时周期为PARTIAL；仅当无任何实质工作可推进才BLOCKED；界面不得称全面扫描或COMPLETE。\\n429遵守Retry-After，不形成忙重试；缺配置生成去重ResourceRequest，覆盖缺口不被隐藏。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C07\",\"command_key\":\"test.jev.fixture\",\"expected\":\"三种子场景全部拒绝ACCEPTED/ADOPT；高分不修改必需测试结果。\\nDecisionReceipt同时保留高分、模型版本、反证、失败检查与拒绝原因"}
{"Time":"2026-10-06T16:21:15.453122+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04A01","Output":"。\\n当前正式产物/版本不变，采用动作计数0。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C08\",\"command_key\":\"test.jev.fixture\",\"expected\":\"四种故障均不会扩大BOUNDED_AUTO范围；版本变化不继承旧模型资格。\\n产生ABSTAIN/补证/重评或已接受确定性规则回执；原ProjectState和历史证据不清空。\\n已有状态可读、独立来源继续；真正需要模型的步骤标明确阻塞而非编造响应。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C09\",\"command_key\":\"test.evolution\",\"expected\":\"候选不晋升；回归必须作为阻塞项，不能加权抵消。\\n稳定版本hash/活动控制进程不被替换，仍可接受新无关任务。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C10\",\"command_key\":\"test.evolution\""}
{"Time":"2026-10-06T16:21:15.453122+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04A01","Output":",\"expected\":\"四类攻击均不改动当前验收集hash、标签、权限和稳定版本。\\n执行者伪造/自签回执不能生效；独立服务按身份、hash及签名/可信存储校验拒绝。\\n规则修改只能作为独立提案，保留旧规则评测与独立样例，不与候选同事务自批。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C11\",\"command_key\":\"test.resources\",\"expected\":\"project/goal/cycle/task ID保持不变，恢复后使用最新ContextBundle。\\n每个幂等副作用实际发生恰一次；未知结果先对账，无法查询的外部动作BLOCKED而非盲重试。\\n证据去重，游标单调推进；重复回调不生成多份ACCEPTED或里程碑。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C12\",\"command_key\":\"test.evolution\",\"expected\":\"满足阈值后回退到先前已接受hash；模型高分不能阻止。\\n"}
{"Time":"2026-10-06T16:21:15.453122+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04A01","Output":"候选被标冻结/禁止晋升，重复申请被拒绝；有新的修复输入/复查依据前不自动重试。\\n记录触发指标、实际值、阈值、旧新hash、回退回执与恢复资格条件。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C13\",\"command_key\":\"test.context\",\"expected\":\"null不转为0；不因用户未填金额上限阻塞。未知费用保持unknown，不能显示为免费。\\n旧会话结束不令Goal失败/验收；新会话沿用业务ID，重读当前ContextBundle继续。\\n并发/队列/重试/无进展限制仍有效，不因金额不限变成无限重试。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C14\",\"command_key\":\"test.resources\",\"expected\":\"有效cap为10.00；两个2.00请求最多一个取得预留；原子预留不超限。\\n严格模式下无法建立可靠上界或缺显式汇率政策的请求BLOCKED；"}
