{"Time":"2026-10-06T16:21:15.4537673+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04A01","Output":"好合格结果及恢复条件；不成为ACCEPTED。\\n子Goal继承相同origin_problem/candidate/input_hash的计数，不清零；新证据/新版本恢复有显式理由记录。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C17\",\"command_key\":\"test.domain\",\"expected\":\"release_id+recipient+channel只存在一条逻辑通知；投递尝试可多次但用户不出现重复卡片。\\n侧栏、通知、成果详情指向同release_id、artifact hash和acceptance_id。\\noutbox待发事件可恢复，已读状态幂等；未配置外部渠道时不发邮件/社交消息，不触发Git push。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C18\",\"command_key\":\"test.ui\",\"expected\":\"revision1显示已验收4/计划6、待评审2；revision2显示已验收4/计划9、待评审2、新增3。\\n标明计划revision及分母6→9；待评审不计已完成，无总"}
